  <header>
    <div>
      <h1>World Cup 2026 Country and Player Guide Meshup</h1>
      <p class="lede">An RDF-backed collection linking the expanded 48-team tournament field with The Guardian's 1,248-player guide metadata.</p>
      <div class="meta-row"><span class="pill">48 teams</span><span class="pill">12 groups</span><span class="pill">Round of 32 path</span><span class="pill">1,248-player guide layer</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section id="overview" class="band"><div class="inner">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <div class="stats"><article class="stat"><strong>48</strong>qualified national teams</article><article class="stat"><strong>12</strong>groups of four</article><article class="stat"><strong>32</strong>knockout qualifiers</article><article class="stat"><strong>1,248</strong>players in the Guardian guide layer</article></div>
      <div class="claims" style="margin-top:18px"><article class="claim-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23claim-expanded-field" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#claim-expanded-field">The 2026 World Cup field expands to 48 teams</a></h3><p>The tournament has 12 groups of four teams, increasing the country-level analysis surface before any player-level scouting begins.</p></article>
<article class="claim-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23claim-country-context" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#claim-country-context">Country qualification data creates the first index</a></h3><p>Group and confederation facts provide a clean table of teams, regions, and opening-stage context.</p></article>
<article class="claim-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23claim-player-context" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#claim-player-context">The Guardian guide supplies the player-level layer</a></h3><p>The Guardian interactive is positioned as a full guide to all 1,248 squad members across the same tournament population.</p></article>
<article class="claim-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23claim-bracket-path" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#claim-bracket-path">The bracket adds the path-to-final layer</a></h3><p>FIFA format guidance connects the group stage to a Round of 32, then Round of 16, quarter-finals, semi-finals, third-place match, and final.</p></article>
<article class="claim-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23claim-meshup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#claim-meshup">The meshup links macro and micro views</a></h3><p>The combined graph links national-team participation, confederation geography, group placement, source provenance, and player-guide coverage.</p></article>
<article class="claim-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23claim-provenance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#claim-provenance">Source provenance is part of the model</a></h3><p>Visual Capitalist and The Guardian are represented as distinct source works so downstream users can distinguish country-list facts from player-guide metadata.</p></article></div>
    </div></section>
    <section id="sources" class="band"><div class="inner">
      <h2>Source Layers</h2>
      <div class="source-grid">
        <article class="source"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23visualCapitalistArticle" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#visualCapitalistArticle">Visual Capitalist country map</a></h3><p>Country, group, and confederation perspective from <a href="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Every Country Playing in the 2026 World Cup</a>.</p></article>
        <article class="source"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23guardianPlayerGuide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#guardianPlayerGuide">The Guardian player guide</a></h3><p>Player-guide metadata from <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/football/ng-interactive/2026/jun/04/world-cup-2026-complete-player-guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">World Cup 2026: guide to all 1,248 players</a>, authored by Marcus Christenson, David Hills, Steven Bloor, Garry Blight, and Billy Munday.</p></article>
        <article class="source"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23fifaFormatGuide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#fifaFormatGuide">FIFA format and bracket guides</a></h3><p>Advancement rules from <a href="https://gpcustomersupportfwc2026.tickets.fifa.com/hc/en-gb/articles/28784798873117-10-What-is-the-format-for-the-FIFA-World-Cup-2026-tournament" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FIFA's format guide</a> and bracket provenance from <a href="https://www.fifa.com/en/articles/knockout-stage-match-schedule-bracket?searchOverlay=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FIFA's knockout-stage bracket</a>.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>
    <section id="groups" class="band"><div class="inner"><h2>Groups and Confederations</h2><div class="groups"><article class="group-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23group-a" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#group-a">Group A</a></h3><ul><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FMexico_national_football_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mexico_national_football_team">Mexico</a> <span>CONCACAF</span></li><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FSouth_Korea_national_football_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/South_Korea_national_football_team">South Korea</a> <span>AFC</span></li><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FCzech_Republic_national_football_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Czech_Republic_national_football_team">Czechia</a> <span>UEFA</span></li><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FSouth_Africa_national_soccer_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/South_Africa_national_soccer_team">South Africa</a> <span>CAF</span></li></ul></article>
<article class="group-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23group-b" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#group-b">Group B</a></h3><ul><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FCanada_men's_national_soccer_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Canada_men's_national_soccer_team">Canada</a> <span>CONCACAF</span></li><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FSwitzerland_national_football_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Switzerland_national_football_team">Switzerland</a> <span>UEFA</span></li><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FQatar_national_football_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Qatar_national_football_team">Qatar</a> <span>AFC</span></li><li><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fdbpedia.org%2Fresource%2FBosnia_and_Herzegovina_national_football_team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bosnia_and_Herzegovina_national_football_team">Bosnia and Herzegovina</a> <span>UEFA</span></li></ul></article>
