    <section id="bracket" class="band"><div class="inner">
      <h2><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23tournamentPathToFinal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#tournamentPathToFinal">Tournament Path to Final</a></h2>
      <p class="bracket-note">This is a structured bracket path, not a prediction. It models FIFA's advancement rules: top two teams from each group plus the eight best third-place teams reach the Round of 32, then single-elimination rounds continue through the final.</p>
      <div class="bracket-flow"><article class="bracket-card"><div class="round-index">1</div><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23round-group-stage" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#round-group-stage">Group stage</a></h3><p>12 groups of four teams; each team plays three group-stage matches.</p><div class="round-meta"><span>48 teams</span><span>72 group-stage matches</span></div></article>
<article class="bracket-card"><div class="round-index">2</div><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23round-of-32" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#round-of-32">Round of 32</a></h3><p>Top two teams from each group plus eight best third-place teams advance.</p><div class="round-meta"><span>32 teams</span><span>16 matches</span></div></article>
<article class="bracket-card"><div class="round-index">3</div><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23round-of-16" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#round-of-16">Round of 16</a></h3><p>Winners from the Round of 32 continue in single elimination.</p><div class="round-meta"><span>16 teams</span><span>8 matches</span></div></article>
<article class="bracket-card"><div class="round-index">4</div><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23quarter-finals" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#quarter-finals">Quarter-finals</a></h3><p>Eight remaining teams compete for semi-final places.</p><div class="round-meta"><span>8 teams</span><span>4 matches</span></div></article>
<article class="bracket-card"><div class="round-index">5</div><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23semi-finals" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#semi-finals">Semi-finals</a></h3><p>Four remaining teams compete for places in the final and third-place match.</p><div class="round-meta"><span>4 teams</span><span>2 matches</span></div></article>
<article class="bracket-card"><div class="round-index">6</div><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23third-place-match" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#third-place-match">Third place match</a></h3><p>Losing semi-finalists contest third place.</p><div class="round-meta"><span>2 teams</span><span>1 match</span></div></article>
<article class="bracket-card"><div class="round-index">7</div><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23final" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#final">Final</a></h3><p>The two finalists meet on 19 July 2026 to determine the champion.</p><div class="round-meta"><span>2 teams</span><span>1 match</span></div></article></div>
      <h3 style="margin-top:26px">Advancement rules</h3>
      <div class="advancement-rules"><article class="rule-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23advancement-top-two" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#advancement-top-two">Group top-two advancement</a></h3><p>The first- and second-place teams in each of the 12 groups advance to the Round of 32.</p></article>
<article class="rule-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23advancement-best-third" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#advancement-best-third">Best third-place advancement</a></h3><p>The eight best third-place teams across all groups also advance to the Round of 32.</p></article>
<article class="rule-card"><h3><a class="entity-link" href="https://linkeddata.uriburner.com/describe/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visualcapitalist.com%2Fevery-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup%2F%23advancement-single-elimination" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-iri="https://www.visualcapitalist.com/every-country-playing-in-the-2026-world-cup/#advancement-single-elimination">Single-elimination knockout</a></h3><p>From the Round of 32 onward, the winner advances and the losing team is eliminated, except the third-place match between semi-final losers.</p></article></div>
      <p class="small">Format source: <a href="https://gpcustomersupportfwc2026.tickets.fifa.com/hc/en-gb/articles/28784798873117-10-What-is-the-format-for-the-FIFA-World-Cup-2026-tournament" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FIFA tournament format guide</a>. Bracket source: <a href="https://www.fifa.com/en/articles/knockout-stage-match-schedule-bracket?searchOverlay=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FIFA knockout-stage bracket</a>.</p>
    </div></section>
